ther \u2026<br/> I intend on \u2026 <br/>I'm planning to \u2026", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " I'd like to visit a restaurant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'd rather go to a vegetarian restaurant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I intend on having steak for dinner.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm planning to go out for dinner with my friend.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Infinitives of Purpose", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Infinitives are the structure to + verb, like <span class = \"strong\">to go</span> or <span class = \"strong\">to see</span>. <br/><br/>Infinitives of purpose are infinitives you place in phrases within a sentence. They explain why the action happens.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can call them to make a reservation.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You have to take a taxi to arrive on time. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Take the bus to arrive quickly.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "To get there fast, I suggest you take a bus.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "steak", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a slice of meat that is grilled or fried", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The steak is delicious at that restaurant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about travel.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "terrific", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very good; excellent", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is a terrific steak restaurant down the street.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "authentic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "real; true", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to eat at an authentic Spanish restaurant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bus", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large vehicle that drives on the road and carries many people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Take the bus to the Spanish restaurant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "train", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large vehicle with many cars that runs on tracks", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The train is the best way to travel in Spain.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "taxi", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a car that people pay to use to travel in a city", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is far. I suggest you take a taxi.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue about visiting a new city with a friend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about where to go and what to do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask the hotel concierge what you can do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 10-12 lines in your dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice the dialogue with you partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about where to go in a city.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I express my intentions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for suggestions when I visit a new 